                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "49d36628-4a81-397d-8230-8f1cb9501124",
                        "entry_id": "58962d27-fc92-38f5-ba37-8b32fe764628",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сделанный из луба"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0101a654-7ec1-4ac1-b9e6-3254ddcc3536",
                                "sense_id": "49d36628-4a81-397d-8230-8f1cb9501124",
                                "text": "С Ветлугн и Унжи шло много лубяного товара, т.е. лубков, мочалы, рогожи и др."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08e219a8-ba3d-4993-b356-a01412cfd7e2",
                                "sense_id": "49d36628-4a81-397d-8230-8f1cb9501124",
                                "text": "Может быть, только липа, дающая все лубяное и лыковое: и мочалки, и рогожи, и сами лапти, — могла бы воскликнуть па суде деревьев… Из липового лубка можно тоже сделать лёгкую прочную посудину, лубяные драночки сапожники закладывали в задники, из лубка делались длинные узкие лунки, по которым катали в пасху по зелёному лужку яркие разноцветные яйца."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a05a4a4b-05d7-360d-82f6-aa563fc8e975",
                        "entry_id": "58962d27-fc92-38f5-ba37-8b32fe764628",
                        "glosses": [
                            "с.-х. имеющий волокно, пригодное для выработки пряжи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c5797d8-6b07-4d1a-a7b8-8cd1923f24f6",
                                "sense_id": "a05a4a4b-05d7-360d-82f6-aa563fc8e975",
                                "text": "Увязочные и прошивочные материалы в виде кручёных шнуров, изготовленных из льнопеньковой пряжи, отбойки (кручёный шпагат), шпагатов увязочных (из лубяных волокон), ниток льняных и хлопчатобумажных применяют при выполнении работ по переплетению пружин, прошивке заготовок, стёжке бортов, зашиванию покровных и облицовочных тканей."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b2f4aca-8523-4020-99f3-c1ca32bc3a85",
                        "source_entry_id": "58962d27-fc92-38f5-ba37-8b32fe764628",
                        "target_lang_word": "bass",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bass",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a1a20a6-35d0-3c73-a6d2-cf1f27916c74",
                                        "entry_id": "fd07e18f-95db-386a-a1b9-26b022558b6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of sound, a voice or an instrument, low in pitch or frequency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa581774-ba83-454e-9c47-75b4c176509a",
                                                "sense_id": "0a1a20a6-35d0-3c73-a6d2-cf1f27916c74",
                                                "text": "The giant spoke in a deep, bass, rumbling voice that shook me to my boots."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bass",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98ed3fd7-8c1e-3b91-80a1-2b20d9d13399",
                                        "entry_id": "690c399a-4875-36d2-80d1-dd6836190577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A low spectrum of sound tones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9d8570-ae1a-4000-b373-7ae53675d1f2",
                                                "sense_id": "98ed3fd7-8c1e-3b91-80a1-2b20d9d13399",
                                                "text": "Peter adjusted the equalizer on his audio equipment to emphasize the bass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff20c16a-62e1-30c9-8ed6-0974af7582ae",
                                        "entry_id": "690c399a-4875-36d2-80d1-dd6836190577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A section of a musical group that produces low-pitched sound, lower than the baritone and tenor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8aae72c-f344-4e77-9e73-acc014744132",
                                                "sense_id": "ff20c16a-62e1-30c9-8ed6-0974af7582ae",
                                                "text": "The conductor preferred to situate the bass in the middle rear, rather than to one side of the orchestra."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ce43b10-2270-3e19-b8eb-13b8e63b58e3",
                                        "entry_id": "690c399a-4875-36d2-80d1-dd6836190577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who sings in the bass range."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f162c5ba-c835-47d2-ab78-9bd1a392bf5c",
                                                "sense_id": "0ce43b10-2270-3e19-b8eb-13b8e63b58e3",
                                                "text": "Halfway through middle school, Edgar morphed from a soprano to a bass, much to the amazement and amusement of his fellow choristers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f587e654-3989-380c-90e8-5650e8c3254d",
                                        "entry_id": "690c399a-4875-36d2-80d1-dd6836190577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instrument that plays in the bass range, in particular a double bass, bass guitar, electric bass or bass synthesiser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d4d06ce-27a8-4258-88d2-7f67e3081a61",
                                                "sense_id": "f587e654-3989-380c-90e8-5650e8c3254d",
                                                "text": "The musician swung the bass over his head like an axe and smashed it into the amplifier, creating a discordant howl of noise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f8879c4-4c4d-3640-b84f-ba98402aa6aa",
                                        "entry_id": "690c399a-4875-36d2-80d1-dd6836190577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The clef sign that indicates that the pitch of the notes is below middle C; a bass clef."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2fd1662-d5d0-42d2-888f-31b42bc3fd54",
                                                "sense_id": "7f8879c4-4c4d-3640-b84f-ba98402aa6aa",
                                                "text": "The score had been written without the treble and bass, but it was easy to pick out which was which based on the location of the notes on the staff."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
